# Versioned in note/: the notes' compilable sources (*.Rnw), the two headers they
# need (asm_preamble.tex, asm_knitr_setup.R), the build script, the data the chunks
# read, the handoff documents, and the built PDFs. Everything else here is a build
# product (unitNN.tex, figs/, _minted*/, LaTeX intermediates) or a local tool.
*
!.gitignore
!*.Rnw
!*.pdf
!asm_preamble.tex
!asm_knitr_setup.R
!build.py
!CONVENTIONS.md
!REVISION.md
!data/
!data/**
